OVERVIEW: Manage the Darwin Swift SDK

USAGE: xtool sdk <subcommand>

OPTIONS:
  --version               Show the version.
  -h, --help              Show help information.

SUBCOMMANDS:
  install (default)       Install the Darwin Swift SDK
  update                  Update the installed Darwin Swift SDK
  remove                  Remove the Darwin Swift SDK
  build                   Build the Darwin SDK from Xcode.xip
  status                  Get the status of the Darwin Swift SDK

  See 'xtool help sdk <subcommand>' for detailed help.
